Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）喂，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很危险的啦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）没事没事只是路过一下而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）就算绕远路，也该从那边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}过去比较好啦……真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这里是死路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不能从工地里面穿过去啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马……工地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.39,0:00:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是什么地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你连这都不知道吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃，那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.97,0:00:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是，那个……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然是施工的地方啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，喂，我们回去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点过来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.59,0:00:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）哎！？哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么追着我跑啊～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要飞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:00:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.94,0:00:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.35,0:01:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说…谁都没坐在上面！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.35,0:01:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小贝）可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连头盔都没戴…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！好痛痛…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然在案发现场晃来晃去！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.24,0:01:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～。话说回来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然脚够不到刹车的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就停不下来啊可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小…小学生开的吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小学生！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷液压小贝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是堂堂的中学生！混账东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～……跟我们一样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是观月小鸟。这边是游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你救了我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绍贝君。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃…啊…呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.40,0:01:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少…少废话，可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好大的卡车啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（绍贝）那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.95,0:01:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算装了300吨的土砂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.31,0:01:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也能轰隆隆地跑起来哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:02:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}300吨…好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（绍贝）不，不是那个吨啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.97,0:02:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边是750吨吊力的履带式起重机！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连火箭都能轻轻松松吊起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的，太牛了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那边也有…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个六边形的零件。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.35,0:02:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那么小的零件{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把各个零件连接在一起吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来，这也太厉害了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，你懂啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.57,0:02:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}懂的吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}男孩子真是的就喜欢这种东西呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好想操纵一下那种东西啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧，对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎么说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就是为了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才参加决斗嘉年华的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（肖贝）在决斗中的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是我这种小身板也能操纵像挖掘机{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.22,0:02:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或者起重机一样的怪兽…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不如说，能和他们合为一体啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得，那种心情我懂。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？你也要参加决斗嘉年华？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:03:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊…先说好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.29,0:03:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷的超绝力量重机卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能打赢的家伙 根本不存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的卡组 力量也足够！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！来一场吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.02,0:03:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.79,0:03:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗目标 锁定！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜从全世界最强的决斗者们聚集而来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.83,0:03:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗嘉年华！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.65,0:03:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要想突破预选赛需要5个心之碎片。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.53,0:03:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 我的心之碎片有2个。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}照这个势头冲进决赛绝对要夺冠！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻就归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷将穿孔重机{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.77,0:05:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钻头巨霸召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.09,0:05:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡突击施工！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是在召唤了重机怪兽的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.31,0:05:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌将1只重机怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.63,0:05:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷将整地重机压路机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后发动钻头巨霸的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1只同伴重机{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升300点！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！重机怪兽好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在不是感叹这个的时候吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}敌人可是召唤了2只怪兽啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷盖1张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，就让你们见识见识
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.27,0:06:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷重机卡组的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤嘎嘎嘎魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了，嘎嘎嘎魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，对手可是攻击力2100
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力2100的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算用攻击力1500的嘎嘎嘎魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，对了！这不妙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用装备魔法啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，对对对！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动装备魔法，反弹魔杖！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反弹魔杖会让装备的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.51,0:07:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升等级×100点的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可就算这样，也才1900！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种程度的强化不痛不痒啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师 1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将等级变成1到8中的任意一个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有这个效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.11,0:07:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动我我我魔术师的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级从4变成8
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.37,0:07:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再提升400点！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 bounce wand 的效果 攻击力是2300！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挺有一套的嘛！可恶啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师 攻击钻头巨汉！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得不错！但是本大爷发动陷阱卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.26,0:07:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧男人的红色灵魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机械族怪兽进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.39,0:07:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.19,0:07:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}踢飞它！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动反弹魔杖的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了反弹魔杖的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗结束时可以特殊召唤那只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 光凭这个状况也不会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.06,0:08:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彻底防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.23,0:08:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备表示的话就算被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩家也不会受到战斗伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了！ 我把 我我我魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放1张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种防守 在老子我的力量面前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为这种防守能通用吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.94,0:08:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷召唤挖掘重机 强力铲斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于重机增加了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钻头巨无霸的攻击力再提升300点！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷用强力铲斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.77,0:09:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动陷阱卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.19,0:09:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}半途中断！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}半途中断的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护其不被战斗破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那场战斗中产生的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对玩家的伤害减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.41,0:09:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，我我我魔术师是守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，这个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.33,0:09:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和你怪兽都毫发无伤是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿…不过这种小把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.46,0:09:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷的重机力量可不是你能匹敌的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}半·破甲的效果现在依然有效！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.10,0:09:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷用钻头巨霸攻击我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.73,0:09:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动钻头巨霸的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钻头巨霸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.91,0:10:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击守备表示怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果攻击力超过其守备力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就那差额给对手的生命值造成伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.03,0:10:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（我我我魔术师）我我我～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈～！看到了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.44,0:10:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高输出 高油耗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以卓越的耐久性为傲{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是高潜能重机怪兽的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？变成守备表示了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃～那个…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钻头巨无霸一旦攻击过一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.47,0:10:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到下一个自己的回合结束都会变成守备表示{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个没法改回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈～！可恶啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说暂时要休息一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……不管什么重型机械{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要想发挥最大的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都得保养才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以就像这样让引擎冷却一下……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这可是个机会啊，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.39,0:10:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:10:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气攻上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.46,0:11:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把我我我魔术师改成攻击表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.87,0:11:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再召唤普利普利斯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，普利普利斯特一回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将攻击力变为零
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以让1只怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让自己的生命值提升800点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动普利普利斯特的怪兽效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将嘎嘎嘎魔术师的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升800点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.44,0:11:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用嘎嘎嘎魔术师攻击强力铲斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎魔术师和普利普利斯特的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.63,0:11:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复原状！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（普利普利斯特）姆～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区重型机械的力量我怎么可能输！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗可不只是靠力量啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.93,0:11:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那除了力量之外，还有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:12:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？啊，你看……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.31,0:12:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个，呃……就那个之类的……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之类的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之类的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之不只是靠力量啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.77,0:12:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有力量的话怎么可能赢啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有力量的那一方肯定更强啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小……小贝？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.19,0:12:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是本大爷小学时候的事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在班里，个子矮小的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}腕力也弱，被大家小看被嘲笑捉弄。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶，开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.93,0:12:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是我能有更强的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在那时，我我遇到了重型机械。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.73,0:12:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我打从心底这么想。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.77,0:12:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要有了重型机械的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就再也不会有人来嘲笑我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要用重型机械怪兽那巨大的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场狂欢节上夺冠！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小贝……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小贝……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.35,0:12:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.81,0:13:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 废铁与重建！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从墓地特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只等级3以下的机械族怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 强力铲斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙从墓地特殊召唤的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级会提升1级。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 本大爷发动魔法卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全面检修！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大检修会将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有机械族怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1级！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识见识。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超重量级的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.34,0:13:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级变为5的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钻头巨无霸 压路机 强力挖掘机
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉碎岩石的钢铁之臂！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！本大爷的怪兽超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重机王 土木·扎克！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3200！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 也太大了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.76,0:14:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是本大爷的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重机王 土木·扎克！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，别大意。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷发动重机王 土木·扎克的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}土木·扎克可以通过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.28,0:14:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对方卡组将3张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送入墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的卡组里的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，根据这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送入墓地的怪兽数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？被送入墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽卡有2张！也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏2只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧，山岳粉碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.98,0:15:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…咕哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的怪兽全灭了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 要是被直接攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打中的话就输了吧…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.92,0:15:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点游马 现在…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好 土木扎克！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全速前进！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？ 吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.23,0:15:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我听不见啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.71,0:15:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不够！ 再更多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让引擎震动起来 土木扎克！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}削掉游马的生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…噗 特拉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}噗特拉？ 噗特拉是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 究极铲斗轮！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.11,0:16:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 陷阱卡微小的抵抗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}微小的抵抗是将墓地里等级4以下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力1000以下的怪兽选1只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力数值对方1只怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 下降！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 圣祭司。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把多波库·扎克的攻击力降下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷的超绝力量怕了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《唔… 总算是撑过去了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但生命值已经只剩100了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽如此 能对付攻击力3200的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.41,0:16:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽什么的》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 看那个。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个… 那是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 我说听不见啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.19,0:17:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《可恶…难道就这样结束了吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.05,0:17:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《嗯 凭你一个人的力量是不行的》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！哎 喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么能听到声音啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.43,0:17:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来 我和你一直是用心声在对话的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.34,0:17:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《啊 对了！》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我今天 在这个叫做施工现场的地方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观察了各种各样的东西{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得知了人类创造出的巨大建筑物{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是将各种各样的零件拼接起来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}组装而成的这件事》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那又怎么了？》那边的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你脚边的六角形零件。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不就是个普通的螺母吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那个六角形零件虽然是个非常小的零件{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却像这样支撑着巨大的建筑物支撑着一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗也是一样的》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《小小的零件支撑起巨大的建筑物…》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}意思是光靠力量不行吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.19,0:18:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 本大爷的超绝力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.59,0:18:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对土木扎克 你是束手无策吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.51,0:18:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.69,0:18:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 栗子球特！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（栗子球特）栗！栗栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力３００！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那种低排量怪兽能干什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动栗子球的怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}土块扎克的超量素材……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以把场上的超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成栗子球衍生物！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.29,0:18:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？超量素材变成怪兽了……！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，就这种程度的家伙就算凑齐3只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也根本不是土块扎克的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 迷你毅力！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.03,0:18:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，栗子球衍生物！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈……就凭这种弱小的怪兽能干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么了，土块扎克！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡 迷你毅力是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过解放2只等级1的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让对手1只怪兽的攻击力变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多波库·扎克竟然……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.11,0:19:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然被那么弱的怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.05,0:19:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决出胜负吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 看我华丽地搞定 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.12,0:19:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用栗子球电击丸攻击多波库·扎克！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 由于迷你胆量的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.11,0:20:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的多波库·扎克的原本攻击力数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 3200点的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肖贝 我要给你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.47,0:20:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}引以为傲的力量反倒害了自己啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.87,0:20:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（肖贝）为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.14,0:21:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 竟然被那么弱小的怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.33,0:21:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弱小的力量也不能小看啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小小的力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是巨大的桥梁，还是这里的建筑{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小小的螺栓和螺母每一颗都在支撑着它们。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我输了，心灵碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.49,0:21:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就归你了，可恶——！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，我确实收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）这样就是第三个了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.59,0:21:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说得没错我迷失了重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.43,0:21:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}建造巨大的东西所需要的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.39,0:21:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不只是巨大的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肖贝君，就算小也很帅哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，那、那个……啊哈哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小小的力量吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.20,0:21:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些家伙，在这种地方干什么呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.10,0:22:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（三人）哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是受伤了可怎么办！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.14,0:22:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（３人）对、对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.92,0:24:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜果然龙就是帅啊！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.77,0:24:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜保护同伴的效果真让人安心！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.26,0:24:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜上吧！霍普剑·混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.61,0:24:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家谢谢你们的众多投票！＞

